+# ours_fx1200_B_proportional.yaml -- Ahmed's detector runs on this launcher (exp/detector-accuracy).
+# Placement B: YOLO on the CPU (onnxruntime), producer on cores 0,1; OV2SLAM on cores 2,3 as
